## Upstream shader

`tonemapper.hlsl` in this repository is a **modified copy** of the shader from:

- **GEEKiDoS/bitblt-hdr** — https://github.com/GEEKiDoS/bitblt-hdr
- License: MIT

Changes made: two constants — `linear_tonemap()`'s knee `z` changed from `0.8` to `1.0`,
and the `step()` threshold in `main()` changed from `0.8` to `1.0`.
Nothing else in the file was touched (line endings and formatting preserved).

Snipaste v2.11 and later embed this upstream shader; this tool recompiles the modified
version and replaces the embedded copy inside `Snipaste.exe`.

